@startuml

hide footbox
title US001 - To register a user in the system

box "Tests" #LightYellow
actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI
end box

participant ":RegisterUserController" as RegisterUserController
participant ":UserRepository" as UserRepository

Administrator -> UI : **1** registerUser(username, contact, profile)

UI -> RegisterUserController : **2** registerUser(username, contact, profile)
activate RegisterUserController

RegisterUserController -> UserRepository : **3** createNewUser(username, contact, profile)
activate UserRepository

create "u1: User" as User
UserRepository -> User : **4** create(username, contact, profile)

UserRepository --> RegisterUserController : **5** u1
deactivate UserRepository

RegisterUserController -> UserRepository : **6** add(u1)
activate UserRepository

UserRepository -> UserRepository : **7** validator(u1)

UserRepository --> RegisterUserController : **8** true
deactivate UserRepository

RegisterUserController --> UI : **9** success
deactivate RegisterUserController

UI --> Administrator : **10** success



@enduml